      "_id": "static-front-flee-grab-enlist-recruiter-related-words",
      "title": "러시아 남성들이 군대에 붙잡히기 전에 도망치고 있다",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">러시아 남성들이 군대에 붙잡히기 전에 도망치고 있다 주제를 다룬 The Economist 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">1. the better to identify their corpses at the <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">front</mark> cf. front: 전선</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">2. Russian men are fleeing before the army can grab them (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">flee</mark>) cf. flee: 도망치다, 탈출하다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">3. plain-clothed recruiters grabbed people off the streets (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">grab</mark>) cf. grab: 붙잡아 가다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">4. Debtors, the unemployed and failing students may be coerced to <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">enlist</mark>. cf. enlist: 입대하다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">5. communication between recruiters and border officers (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">recruiter</mark>) cf. recruiter: 징집관, 모병관</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">6. Recruitment quotas are being sent to regional governors (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">recruitment quota</mark>) cf. recruitment quota: 징집 할당량</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">7. Ukrainian officials have predicted a <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">call-up</mark> of at least 100,000 men cf. call-up: 소집(령)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">8. includes electronic summonses (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">summons</mark>) cf. summons: 소환장</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">9. Russian <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">conscript</mark> puts on military uniform before departing for service cf. conscript: 징집병</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">10. Vladimir Putin declared a partial <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">mobilisation</mark> in September 2022 cf. mobilisation: 동원</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">11. Vladimir Putin looks poised for a huge wave of forced inductions (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">forced induction</mark>) cf. forced induction: 강제 징집</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">12. markedly more tenacious and capable than Russian <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">infantry</mark> cf. infantry: 보병</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">13. the more <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">emphatically</mark> authorities deny planning something unpleasant cf. emphatically: 단호하게</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">14. Ukrainian soldiers reported them to be markedly more <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">tenacious</mark> and capable than Russian infantry. cf. tenacious: 끈질긴, 집요한</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">15. If Russia treats mobilised soldiers as <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">cannon fodder</mark> cf. cannon fodder: 총알받이</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">16. the <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">epochal struggle</mark> against Nazi Germany cf. epochal struggle: 시대적 대투쟁</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DaiWDe438Qc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"nv-yt-thumb\">\n  <a class=\"nv-yt-thumb-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DaiWDe438Qc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"유튜브 영상 보기\">\n    <span class=\"nv-yt-thumb-frame\">\n      <img class=\"nv-yt-thumb-img\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/DaiWDe438Qc/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube thumbnail\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://img.youtube.com/vi/DaiWDe438Qc/mqdefault.jpg'\">\n      <span class=\"nv-yt-thumb-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    </span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Economist | Russian men are fleeing before the army can grab them</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.economist.com/europe/2026/10/12/russian-men-are-fleeing-before-the-army-can-grab-them\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
